  "texts": [
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "text": "About Me",
      "box": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 410,
        "w": 111,
        "h": 27
      },
      "font": "adobe-caslon-w01-smbd, serif",
      "size": "26px",
      "weight": "400",
      "style": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28.6px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "color": "rgb(15, 35, 6)",
      "align": "start",
      "transform": "capitalize",
      "decoration": "none"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "text": "Art has been a part of my life for as long as I can remember. My mom studied graphic design, so our house was always filled with art supplies that I loved playing with. Her appreciation for design and visual storytelling shaped how I see the world around me, eventually inspiring me to try and create art myself.",
      "box": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 819,
        "w": 342,
        "h": 209
      },
      "font": "alfabet, sans-serif",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "style": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.4px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "color": "rgb(15, 35, 6)",
      "align": "start",
      "transform": "none",
      "decoration": "none"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "text": "Since childhood, I've spent countless hours drawing, painting, and exploring ways to create. What began as a passion became an important way for me to interpret and connect with the world.",
      "box": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 1029,
        "w": 328,
        "h": 139
      },
      "font": "alfabet, sans-serif",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "style": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.4px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "color": "rgb(15, 35, 6)",
      "align": "start",
      "transform": "none",
      "decoration": "none"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "text": "I believe art is a continuous process of exploration rather than perfection. Each project is an opportunity to refine my skills, experiment with new ideas, and develop a stronger artistic voice. Whether working in traditional or digital media, I strive to create work that is thoughtful, intentional, and visually compelling.",
      "box": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 1170,
        "w": 338,
        "h": 209
      },
      "font": "alfabet, sans-serif",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "style": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.4px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "color": "rgb(15, 35, 6)",
      "align": "start",
      "transform": "none",
      "decoration": "none"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "text": "Skip to Main Content\nAbout Me\n\n   Art has been a part of my life for as long as I can remember. My mom studied graphic design, so our house was always filled with art supplies that I loved playing with. Her appreciation for design and visual storytelling shaped how I see the world around me, eventually inspiring me to try and create art myself.\n\n   Since childhood, I've spent countless hours drawing, painting, and exploring ways to create. What began as a passion became an important way for me to interpret and connect with the world.\n\n   I believe art is a continuous process of exploration rather than perfection. Each project is an opportunity to refine my skills, experiment with new ideas, and develop a stronger artistic voice. Whether working in traditional or digital media, I strive to create work that is thoughtful, intentional, and visually compelling.",
